  message: "From WI-mofil (local branch jgstern-agent/fix/mofil-swift-named-receiver-binding-forms, a7d20798f2, not merged): a closure (`lambda_literal`) is now a receiver-typing SCOPE of its own and an ANNOTATED closure parameter binds into it (`_bind(node, name, type, visible_from)`). So the forEach/map arm this item needs is a `_bind` of the element type into the closure's scope -- no new scoping work. Unannotated closure parameters in general (not only iteration) are filed as WI-zobif-bajak-duziv-folan-gurom-paput-tolij-situb; iteration stays here. WI-mofil counted for-in loop variables at vapor 7, hummingbird 8, Kingfisher 4, Alamofire 7, swift-argument-parser 5 (lowercase-hint untyped sites, same-file)."  # 2749
